    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBeautiful A Rated Four Bedroom Semi Detached Home\n\nSavills is delighted to introduce 2 Rosewell to the open market, a superb 4 bedroom semi detached house in immaculate order throughout awash with modern features and specification. \n\nThe accommodation begins with a bright entrance hallway, leading to a spacious front lounge complete with stove. To the rear, the property opens into a superb open plan kitchen/dining/living space complemented by a modern sun room that floods the home with natural light. The open plan area is south facing and is ideal for modern living and connects seamlessly to the patio and rear garden. A utility room, guest WC and understairs storage complete the ground floor. \n\nUpstairs, the layout is well considered and provides excellent bedroom accommodation. There are three double bedrooms, including one en suite, along with a stylish main bathroom. On the second floor, you will find a fourth double bedroom and an additional bathroom, offering superb flexibility for guests, work or family use.\n\nOutside, the front of the property includes a cobble lock driveway with easy side access. The south facing rear garden features a paved patio ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining, along with a lawn, mature planting and a steel shed, all enclosed by a block wall and timber fencing for privacy and shelter.\n\nBallinlough Road is a mature, highly convenient location with excellent schools, local shops, bus routes, cafés and parks all within a short walk. It offers quick access to the city centre, Douglas and key transport routes, making day-to-day living straightforward. The area has a strong community feel and remains one of Cork's most dependable and desirable addresses. This home will appeal to a wide range of buyers, those trading up seeking more space and long-term comfort, buyers relocating who want a solid, well connected base in a mature area, and first-time purchasers looking for a forever home rather than a steppingstone. Its layout, modern features and strong location make it a smart fit for anyone prioritising practicality, longevity and ease of living.\n\nGround Floor\nEntrance hallway \nKitchen/dining/living room\nLounge \nSun room \nUtility room\nGuest WC\nCloakroom\n\nFirst Floor\nBedroom 1, en suite\nBedroom 2 \nBedroom 3\nMain bathroom \n\nSecond Floor\nBedroom 4\nBathroom"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
